WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.460
You cannot defeat us, you cannot slow us,

00:02.460 --> 00:05.860
you cannot stop us, you cannot deter us.

00:05.860 --> 00:08.920
We will carry Charlie and Erica in our heart

00:08.920 --> 00:12.600
every single day and fight that much harder

00:12.600 --> 00:15.540
because of what you did to us.

00:15.540 --> 00:19.340
You have no idea the dragon you have awakened.

00:19.340 --> 00:23.400
You have no idea how determined we will be

00:23.400 --> 00:27.160
to save this civilization, to save the West,

00:27.160 --> 00:32.160
to save this Republic because our children are strong

00:33.040 --> 00:35.360
and our grandchildren will be strong

00:35.360 --> 00:38.520
and our children's children's children will be strong.

00:38.520 --> 00:40.660
And what will you leave behind?

00:40.660 --> 00:43.000
Nothing, nothing.

00:43.000 --> 00:45.220
To our enemies, you have nothing to give,

00:45.220 --> 00:48.000
you have nothing to offer, you have nothing to share,

00:48.000 --> 00:49.440
but bitterness.

00:49.440 --> 00:52.680
We have beauty, we have light, we have goodness,

00:52.680 --> 00:56.660
we have determination, we have vision, we have strength.

00:56.660 --> 00:59.800
We've built the world that we inhabit now,

00:59.800 --> 01:04.040
generation by generation, and we will defend this world.

01:04.040 --> 01:06.660
We will defend goodness, we will defend light,

01:06.660 --> 01:08.360
we will defend virtue.

01:08.360 --> 01:12.020
You cannot terrify us, you cannot frighten us,

01:12.020 --> 01:16.920
you cannot threaten us because we are on the side of goodness,

01:16.920 --> 01:18.680
we are on the side of God.

01:18.680 --> 01:23.940
And to my friend, Charlie, to my brother, Charlie,

01:23.940 --> 01:26.940
I know you are looking at us right now.

01:26.940 --> 01:29.360
I know you're watching Erica right now.

01:29.360 --> 01:31.360
I know you're watching your children right now.

